  "ingredients": [
    "265 gram cauliflower (riced)",
    "1/2 cup almond flour",
    "1 tablespoon psyllium husk powder",
    "1/2 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1/2 teaspoon onion powder",
    "3 ounce bacon",
    "16 ounce ground beef (80/20)",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "4 ounce cheddar cheese",
    "3 large egg",
    "2 tablespoon mayonnaise",
    "2 tablespoon low-carb ketchup",
    "1 tablespoon dijon mustard"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F. Rice the cauliflower in a food processor, then remove to a large bowl. To the bowl, add the almond flour, psyllium husk powder, garlic powder, and onion powder and mix together. Set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheeseburger-casserole/#wprm-recipe-51815-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/IMG_4720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Process the bacon and ground beef in the food processor until crumbly and slightly pasty. Cook over medium-high heat, seasoning with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheeseburger-casserole/#wprm-recipe-51815-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/IMG_4724.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shred the cheese while the meat is cooking. Once the meat is cooked through, combine it with the dry ingredients/cauli rice in the large bowl and add half of the cheddar cheese.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheeseburger-casserole/#wprm-recipe-51815-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/IMG_4730.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the eggs, mayonnaise, ketchup, and mustard to the mixture. Mix everything together well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheeseburger-casserole/#wprm-recipe-51815-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/IMG_4732.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the mixture into a baking pan lined with parchment paper. Top with the remaining cheddar.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheeseburger-casserole/#wprm-recipe-51815-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/IMG_4737.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place on the top rack and bake for 25–30 minutes. For additional crispness on top, broil for 2–3 minutes or until browned.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheeseburger-casserole/#wprm-recipe-51815-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/IMG_4740.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the oven and let cool for 5–10 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheeseburger-casserole/#wprm-recipe-51815-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/IMG_4748.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice, serve, and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheeseburger-casserole/#wprm-recipe-51815-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
